    "method": "Every printed verse is retained. Each recording independently matches the complete performed cycles with spatial and optical rhythm templates; the opening cannot skip a complete cycle. First-verse full/local paths agree within 0.5 seconds; subsequent local paths also agree with independently measured musical repeat phases. Positions are early reading previews. Additional accompaniment cycles are measured and retain the final printed reading, without inventing additional lyric verses.",
    "performanceOrder": [
      {
        "region": "s1_v1",
        "text": "我主耶稣，为我钉死十架，",
        "label": "第1段：第1谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s2_v1",
        "text": "流血牺牲，使我得着救恩；",
        "label": "第1段：第2谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s3_v1",
        "text": "十架，十架，神爱浩大！",
        "label": "第1段：第3谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s4_v1",
        "text": "我信，我信，尽我全生！",
        "label": "第1段：第4谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s1_v2",
        "text": "我主耶稣，为我埋于坟墓，",
        "label": "第2段：第1谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s2_v2",
        "text": "沉寂无声，为我经历死难；",
        "label": "第2段：第2谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s3_v2",
        "text": "埋葬，埋葬，神子受苦！",
        "label": "第2段：第3谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s4_v2",
        "text": "我信，我信，终必凯旋！",
        "label": "第2段：第4谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s1_v3",
        "text": "我主耶稣，为我死里复活，",
        "label": "第3段：第1谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s2_v3",
        "text": "冲破黑暗，赐我生命力量；",
        "label": "第3段：第2谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s3_v3",
        "text": "得胜，得胜，神权掌握！",
        "label": "第3段：第3谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s4_v3",
        "text": "我信，我信，靠主刚强！",
        "label": "第3段：第4谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s1_v4",
        "text": "我主耶稣，为我赐下圣灵，",
        "label": "第4段：第1谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s2_v4",
        "text": "启示光照，领我奔走前程；，",
        "label": "第4段：第2谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s3_v4",
        "text": "奇妙，奇妙，神恩无尽！",
        "label": "第4段：第3谱行"
      },
      {
        "region": "s4_v4",
        "text": "我信，我信，荣耀归神！（阿们）",
        "label": "第4段：第4谱行"
      }
    ],
